{"4730500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "At Night : Freakshow", "steam_appid": 4730500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4744300], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/a074b1bc8be89447cfb1f50a1d7e6e08.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/a074b1bc8be89447cfb1f50a1d7e6e08.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/a074b1bc8be89447cfb1f50a1d7e6e08.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>bearded lady</strong> with a soft voice,<br>A <strong>crippled clown</strong> who crawls for laughs,<br>A <strong>cannonball woman</strong> who flies because the crowd paid to see her fall,<br>A <strong>Ringmaster</strong> who watches every mistake,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/cf5e8bedb5b4e9a3372bc60ef3343bc1.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/cf5e8bedb5b4e9a3372bc60ef3343bc1.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/cf5e8bedb5b4e9a3372bc60ef3343bc1.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, <strong>The Birdman.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet performer with a parrot that speaks for him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live among the freaks, the performers, and the people who come to <strong>laugh at you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/8485af01252b7d77ec226723e8d6fd82.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/8485af01252b7d77ec226723e8d6fd82.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/8485af01252b7d77ec226723e8d6fd82.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Night: Freakshow</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience where you take the role of a protected witness hiding inside a freakshow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode, you follow <strong>Samuel Finch</strong>, placed inside <strong>The Carnival of Second Lives</strong> by the FBI after becoming involved in <strong>The At Night Case</strong>. To keep him hidden, they give him a new name, a new act, and a new <strong>life</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Carnival of Second Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not just a place for entertainment, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a refuge for the unwanted, a stage for the broken,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a business built on turning pain into applause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/6f8947868a972e57e0b632ac1bf4010a.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/6f8947868a972e57e0b632ac1bf4010a.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/6f8947868a972e57e0b632ac1bf4010a.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is structured around daily work inside the carnival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell tickets to guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to rumors around the tents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the freakshow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform tricks with your parrot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your tent when the lights go out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, the show changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/8b32c960b968c87c1eabced01e170b16.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/8b32c960b968c87c1eabced01e170b16.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/8b32c960b968c87c1eabced01e170b16.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic story set in the <strong>At Night</strong> universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnival and freakshow setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform as Birdman using parrot-based tricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell tickets, talk to guests, and explore between shows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing character stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven gameplay with multiple chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minutes of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/d4397069238ad7874696186d862cac9f.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/d4397069238ad7874696186d862cac9f.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/d4397069238ad7874696186d862cac9f.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your beak shut and don't make them find out who you are.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/a074b1bc8be89447cfb1f50a1d7e6e08.poster.avif?t=1785450162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/a074b1bc8be89447cfb1f50a1d7e6e08.webm?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730500/extras/a074b1bc8be89447cfb1f50a1d7e6e08.mp4?t=1785450162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>bearded lady</strong> with a soft voice,<br>A <strong>crippled clown</strong> who crawls for laughs,<br>A <strong>cannonball woman</strong> who flies because the crowd paid to see her fall,<br>A <strong>Ringmaster</strong> who watches every mistake,</p><